# Copy this file to .env.namespace_override and set SUPER_PROJECTS_NAME.
# Omitting the copy silently keeps super_projects and will share volumes,
# network, container name, and the ssh-agent socket with any other default
# clone on this Docker daemon.
#
# Isolates volumes, network, container name, and the host ssh-agent socket.
# Do not quote the value, prefix export, or use spaces.
# compose down the old project first before changing an existing name (or otherwise remove the containers);
# volumes do not migrate.

# Initialize with the following command (or create a file named .env.namespace_override inside .devcontainer and copy the contents of this file into it):
# cp .devcontainer/.env.namespace_override.example .devcontainer/.env.namespace_override
SUPER_PROJECTS_NAME=super_projects
